    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/c221e0b24c5f3b9074113fc67dfe21dd.poster.avif?t=1750853008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/c221e0b24c5f3b9074113fc67dfe21dd.webm?t=1750853008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw &amp; Guess is an online party game where you can draw and guess in various modes with up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your art skills (for better or worse), test your analytical mind, and create some memorably fun moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/049ce6beda9901aeaee6f4a46fdd1536.avif?t=1750853008\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whisper</strong> (4-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just as in <i>Telephone</i> and <i>Chinese Whispers</i>, everyone draws and guesses at the same time in an attempt to keep the results true to the original prompt. Try to avoid turning &quot;bunny&quot; into &quot;killer monster truck&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stage</strong> (2-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your classic match of drawing and guessing! One player draws while the others try to guess the correct word. The faster the word is guessed correctly, the more points you earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lounge</strong> (1-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with others with no time restraints. Get creative and work together on creating something unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robot</strong> (1-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this drawing-only mode, our AI friend (don't worry, no AI-generated art here) GU-355 will try to guess your word prompt. The easier to recognize your piece, the more points you'll get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NEW: Battle Royale</strong> (10-63 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with up to 62 other players and try to make it to the final round for a special reward. All you have to do is draw images our guessing unit can identify better than those of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/fe5c428df213bf50ff52c37b4e97b291.avif?t=1750853008\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If simply drawing and guessing is too easy, scale up the challenge by adjusting the settings. Try <i>Pixel Art</i>, <i>Invisible Lines</i>, or <i>Gravity</i>! If that's not enough, adjust the timer for short-speed rounds or drawing marathons. You can also create and share your own wordlists with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make some new drawing friends over on our discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/c221e0b24c5f3b9074113fc67dfe21dd.poster.avif?t=1750853008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/c221e0b24c5f3b9074113fc67dfe21dd.webm?t=1750853008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw &amp; Guess is an online party game where you can draw and guess in various modes with up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your art skills (for better or worse), test your analytical mind, and create some memorably fun moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/049ce6beda9901aeaee6f4a46fdd1536.avif?t=1750853008\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whisper</strong> (4-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just as in <i>Telephone</i> and <i>Chinese Whispers</i>, everyone draws and guesses at the same time in an attempt to keep the results true to the original prompt. Try to avoid turning &quot;bunny&quot; into &quot;killer monster truck&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stage</strong> (2-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your classic match of drawing and guessing! One player draws while the others try to guess the correct word. The faster the word is guessed correctly, the more points you earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lounge</strong> (1-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with others with no time restraints. Get creative and work together on creating something unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robot</strong> (1-16 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this drawing-only mode, our AI friend (don't worry, no AI-generated art here) GU-355 will try to guess your word prompt. The easier to recognize your piece, the more points you'll get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NEW: Battle Royale</strong> (10-63 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with up to 62 other players and try to make it to the final round for a special reward. All you have to do is draw images our guessing unit can identify better than those of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483870/extras/fe5c428df213bf50ff52c37b4e97b291.avif?t=1750853008\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If simply drawing and guessing is too easy, scale up the challenge by adjusting the settings. Try <i>Pixel Art</i>, <i>Invisible Lines</i>, or <i>Gravity</i>! If that's not enough, adjust the timer for short-speed rounds or drawing marathons. You can also create and share your own wordlists with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make some new drawing friends over on our discord!</p>",
